"""Tests for contrib/hcom-gui: `contrib/test-hcom-gui` (re-runs itself under xvfb-run).

hcom is never called: hcom_json is replaced by fixtures, and commands are recorded
instead of run. Config and window state point into a temporary directory under tmp/.
"""

